WEBVTT

00:11:28.058 --> 00:11:31.985
Hivyo siyo kusema kwamba sikuwa na mashaka yangu njiani.

00:11:32.689 --> 00:11:36.350
Ndege ilipotua Cape Town,

00:11:36.374 --> 00:11:37.977
Nakumbuka kufikiri,

00:11:38.001 --> 00:11:42.207
"Kwa nini sikujipatia mtaalamu na chupa ya vodka

00:11:42.231 --> 00:11:44.447
kama mtu wa kawaida? "

00:11:44.471 --> 00:11:47.391
(Vicheko)

00:11:47.415 --> 00:11:50.620
Wakati mwingine, utafiti wetu
wa uelewa Cape Town

00:11:50.644 --> 00:11:52.811
ulionekana kama jitihada isiyowezekana,

00:11:52.835 --> 00:11:54.934
na nilitaka kukata tu tamaa

00:11:54.958 --> 00:11:57.174
na kurudi nyumbani kwa mume wangu mpenzi, Vidir,

00:11:57.198 --> 00:11:58.409
na mtoto wetu.

00:11:59.994 --> 00:12:02.357
Lakini licha ya matatizo yetu,